> no longer calculate B-D installability for those packages, which
> sorta defeats the purpose of adding it.

I was just made aware of this problem by wookey.

I'm responsible for most patches adding build profile support in this list =
[1]
so if you identify where the problem is, I might be able to come up with a
patch that adds support for build profiles.

Maybe it is only that some of the involved software on debian-ports has not=
 yet
been upgraded to a version with build profile support? You can check the
version requirements at [1].

Thanks!

cheers, josch

[1] https://wiki.debian.org/BuildProfileSpec#Document_status

